OL,3,GNEWSAMP 'furious' about plans for car
OL,4,Aparking charges
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP said she was "furious" over plans
OL,7,Fto introduce parking charges in parts
OL,8,Fof North Northamptonshire.
OL,10,FThe Reform UK-led North
OL,11,FNorthamptonshire Council is proposing
OL,12,Ffees at several car parks in
OL,13,FWellingborough and a number of sites in
OL,14,FRushden.
OL,16,FThe council said the plans would create
OL,17,Fa consistent approach to parking and
OL,18,Fensure its car parks cover their own
OL,19,Fcosts, but that no decision has been
OL,20,Ftaken yet.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
