OL,3,GNEWSAMP 'furious' about plans for car
OL,4,Aparking charges
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Labour MP for Wellingborough and
OL,7,FRushden, Gen Kitchen, said: "I'm
OL,8,Ffurious... You cannot claim to support
OL,9,Four town centres while bringing in
OL,10,Fcharges that will harm workers and
OL,11,Fbusinesses."
